  #line-at(70.8pt, 415.08pt, "Abstract ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.8pt, 442.68pt, "Membrane distillation (MD) stands at the forefront of desalination technology, harnessing the ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 470.28pt, "power of phase change to separate water vapor from saline using minimal energy resources ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 497.88pt, "efficiently. In response to this challenge, membranes with tuned pores morphology and surface ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 525.48pt, "chemistry with biomimetic 3D pine-like structures with improved affinity to water ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 553.08pt, "(desalination) and/or hazardous VOC (VOC removal) were developed and studied ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 580.68pt, "systematically. By implementing VIPS-PVDF membranes and a green modifier of 1-")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 608.28pt, "adamantanamine for the first time, membranes with a revolutionary network architecture were ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 635.88pt, "generated. The modifier was introduced either physically to the polymeric matrix or chemically ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 663.48pt, "through covalent attachment onto the surface and inside the porous structure. As a result, ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 691.08pt, "membranes that defy wetting under extreme hydrostatic pressures (>11.5 bar) were produced ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 718.68pt, "while preserving unparalleled vapor transport efficiency. The 1-adamantanamine promotes ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 746.28pt, "transport and enhances the affinity to the VOC, ensuring excellent membrane performance at ")
]

