#original-page(595.32pt, 841.92pt, (image("graphics/page-04.png", width: 443pt), 74.5pt, 83pt))[
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(294.84pt, 804pt, "4 ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.8pt, 81.96pt, "remote areas [15-18]. Another important application of the MD process is the removal of ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 109.56pt, "volatile and hazardous organic compounds from water [19-21]. ")
  #line-at(106.2pt, 137.16pt, "Independently from the MD applications, the core of the process is a membrane that ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 164.76pt, "needs to be very often modified to enhance the properties, resistance, and lifespan. To tune ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 192.36pt, "mentioned features, the membrane can be modified ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(324.84pt, 192.36pt, "via")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(339.48pt, 192.36pt, " different pathways, including coating ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 219.96pt, "[3, 22-24], grafting [25-27], or incorporation of fillers, ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(343.32pt, 219.96pt, "e.g.,")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(363.6pt, 219.96pt, " perfluorooctanoic acid-modified ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 247.56pt, "melamine (PFOM) [28], microfibrillated cellulose [29], ZIF [30], reduced graphene oxide ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 275.16pt, "functionalized with ionic liquids [31], and bentonite [32]. Although surface coating is ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 302.76pt, "considered the simplest and most efficient process, its physical type of modification is required ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 330.36pt, "to repeat the process periodically. Therefore, more attention is paid to the chemical ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 357.96pt, "functionalization of the materials through stable covalent bonding, giving a very resistant and ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 385.56pt, "robust surface. Membrane functionalization can also often impair the permeability of ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 413.16pt, "membranes by growing their hydrodynamic resistance. Another essential issue is a ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 440.76pt, "sustainability perspective. Most modifiers applied in membrane modification are synthetic ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 468.36pt, "chemicals potentially harmful to the environment and humans [33, 34]. This is why researchers ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 495.96pt, "focus on green alternatives in membrane adjustment, like naturally occurring modified poly ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 523.56pt, "(catechol/polyamine) [35], epigallocatechin gallate/Ag nanoparticles [36], xanthan gum [37], ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 551.16pt, "and pyrogallol/taurine [33], cinnamic acid [38], functionalized carbon nanotubes [39]. The ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 578.76pt, "solutions brought to membrane science in the frame of green chemistry and sustainability cover ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 606.36pt, "also the application of non-fluorinated modifiers, ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(317.16pt, 606.36pt, "e.g.,")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(337.44pt, 606.36pt, " fluorine-free silane and carbon-based ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 633.96pt, "materials [40, 41]. Therefore, there is a severe need for an effective, economical, and eco-")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 661.56pt, "friendly method to functionalize membranes for MD. Thus, taking the results of the cited-above ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 689.16pt, "studies, the major current directions in MD science are not only increasing membrane ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 716.76pt, "hydrophobicity defying wetting at high pressures and enhancing vapor transport efficiency, but ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 744.36pt, "searching for new eco and people – and people-friendly modifiers assuring that. This is why we ")
]

