#original-page(595.32pt, 841.92pt, (image("graphics/page-05.png", width: 346pt), 138pt, 110.5pt))[
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(294.84pt, 804pt, "5 ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.8pt, 81.96pt, "focus our attention on 1 – Adamantanamine. This molecule is gaining more and more attention ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 109.56pt, "in the scientific world, including medicine [42], chemistry [43-45], and engineering and ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 137.16pt, "renewable energy sectors [46, 47]. The enantioselective Strecker reaction of phosphinoyl imines ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 164.76pt, "serves as a catalyst [48]. It is also a starting agent for synthesizing adamantane derivatives, such ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 192.36pt, "as amantadine hydrochloride, which has a vast significance in the pharmaceutical industry. This ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 219.96pt, "component is broadly utilized for treating influenza [49, 50], as an antiviral [42, 51] and an ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 247.56pt, "antiparkinsonian medication. The antiviral medication amantadine provides moderate ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 275.16pt, "improvement in motor function for patients with Parkinson's disease  [52, 53]. Memantine has ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 302.76pt, "beneficial effects on memory in patients with advanced Alzheimer's disease who are already ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 330.36pt, "receiving acetylcholinesterase inhibitors [54]. 1-Adamantanamine also found a lot of ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 357.96pt, "applications in material science and engineering. Liu at el. [55] applied the layer of 1-")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 385.56pt, "adamantanamine onto the upper surface of the perovskite film to heal the defects of the ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 413.16pt, "perovskite surface improving the stability and efficiency of perovskite solar cells. Singh and ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 440.76pt, "co-workers [56] applied 1-adamantanamine-based triazole-appended organosilanes for ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 468.36pt, "determination of Sn")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(166.08pt, 463.8pt, "2+")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(174.72pt, 468.36pt, " in environmental soil samples.  ")
  #line-at(106.2pt, 495.96pt, "Considering the interesting features, the lack of toxicity confirmed by a great utility in ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 523.56pt, "medicine, and the availability of the amine moiety, 1-adamantanamine can be easily and ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 551.16pt, "effectively used in membrane functionalization ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(307.8pt, 551.16pt, "via")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(322.56pt, 551.16pt, " chemical treatment. For that reason, we ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 578.76pt, "proposed, for the first time, the implementation of this molecule in tuning the surface ")
