  #line-at(106.32pt, 109.68pt, "Utilizing the principles of biomimicry, hybrid separation materials with green modifiers ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 137.28pt, "were developed. The addition of 1-adamantanamine, either physically or chemically, vastly ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 164.88pt, "improved the membranes' transport and separation capabilities in MD application by ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 192.48pt, "introducing surface pine-like structures. These meticulously crafted structures, obtained using ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 220.08pt, "a green modifier (producing eco-friendly membranes), drastically increase hydrophobicity, and ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 247.68pt, "show very good performance in removing hazardous VOCs such as EtOH and MTBE from ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 275.28pt, "water, contributing to a cleaner and safer environment. The introduction of 1-adamantanamine ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 302.88pt, "has, simultaneously, notably enhanced transport and separation capabilities, thus, the transport ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 330.48pt, "was enhanced above 3.6 times, and the separation factor beta changed from 3.48 to 15.22 for ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 358.08pt, "MTBE removal and from 2.0 to 3.46 for EtOH removal when comparing pristine PVDF with ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 385.68pt, "the membrane chemically modified with 1-adamantanamine (PVDF_Ch02). The process ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 413.28pt, "separation index during the MTBE removal changed from 20 kg m")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(392.64pt, 408.72pt, "-2")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(399.36pt, 413.28pt, " h")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(408.36pt, 408.72pt, "-1")
