  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(85.68pt, 440.88pt, "(PVDF_Ch02). For EtOH removal, the PSI rose from 8.2 kg m")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(387.6pt, 436.32pt, "-2")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(394.32pt, 440.88pt, " h")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(403.32pt, 436.32pt, "-1")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(409.92pt, 440.88pt, " (PVDF) to 47 kg m")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(506.16pt, 436.32pt, "-2")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(512.76pt, 440.88pt, " h")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(521.76pt, 436.32pt, "-")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 463.92pt, "1 ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(77.76pt, 468.48pt, "(PVDF_Ch02). PVDF_Ch02 was the most effective membrane. The material with the best ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 496.08pt, "efficiency and durability was prepared via chemical modification with the higher concentration ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 523.68pt, "of modifier, ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(129.48pt, 523.68pt, "i.e.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(144.12pt, 523.68pt, ", 0.2M. All materials were highly stable and durable during the MD applications, ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 551.28pt, "and the implementation of new membranes in the study of droplet freezing on a cold plate ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 578.76pt, "allowed to draw new conclusions describing the mechanistic aspects of this process. Summing ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 606.36pt, "up, since 1-adamantanamine promotes transport and enhances the affinity to the VOC, ensuring ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 633.96pt, "excellent membrane performance at different applications of the MD process, it is a very ")
  #line-at(70.92pt, 661.56pt, "promising eco-friendly compound for future membrane improvement. ")
